# Improvisation Capstone: Walking Ballista ({X}{X}) has mana value 0 in exile (CR 202.3e), so it adds nothing to the total
# and the exile goes on through four Lightning Bolts (1+1+1+1) rather than stopping at the Ballista; and cast for free it
# has X = 0 (ruling: "you must choose 0 as the value of X"), so it enters with no counters and dies as a 0/0. The fifth
# Bolt stays in the library. Bot1 casts only the Ballista; the four Bolts stay exiled.

